{"ID":"20240314091809-1w27y8d","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091809-1w27y8d","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091809-1w27y8d\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171026-yfs6dls\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171026-97li6q8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171026-97li6q8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"【当归散】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422171026"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422171026-yfs6dls","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422171026-yfs6dls","updated":"20240422171026"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"妇人妊娠，宜常服当归散。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171026-ihf27h4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171026-ihf27h4","updated":"20240422171026"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"当归散方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171026-np2jcas","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171026-np2jcas","updated":"20240422171026"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"当归黄芩芍药芎藭各一斤白朮半斤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171026-5i4morc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171026-5i4morc","updated":"20240422171026"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右五味，杵为散，酒服方寸匕，日再服，妊娠常服即易产，胎无所苦，産后百病悉主之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171026-fn1xv67","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171026-fn1xv67","updated":"20240422171026"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"接着呢我们看，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"妇人怀孕，适合常常吃当归散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。我们如果 1 月到 10 月啊，怀孕10 个月，刚开始已经讲过了，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"前面 60 天呢你可以给妇人吃桂枝汤，第三个月到第五个月，这一段时间呢讲的就是当归散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，后边呢还有一个处方。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当归散呢是养孕妇用的，保护妈妈的，不是保护小孩"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171026-drwe6vz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171026-drwe6vz","updated":"20240422171026"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个当归散的处方你看啊，这个妇人常常要吃当归散。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄芩能够去热"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因为孕妇在怀孕的中间身上都会有点热，尤其胃，为什么？因为胃口会开的很大，吃的饭比平常多了很多啊，黄芩呢能够去胃的热啊，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"芍药呢能够好让下焦、肚子活血化瘀"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"芍药你吃得多并不能堕胎的，你放心啊！并不像丹皮、桃仁呐那样子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"川芎、白术"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"啊...这个当归散呢因为能够让胃的虚热降下去，同时呢补血、能够活血，所以能够养妈妈的身体，体力很好，那这是散剂啊！"}]},{"ID":"20240422171026-vu1eryo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171026-vu1eryo","updated":"20240422171026"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那如果说，你这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"怀孕的时候常常吃，很容易生产"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因为妈妈身体会很好啊！那怀胎呢不会有什么痛苦。因为你这个怀孕期间没有什么痛苦，白术就可以把水排掉啦，所以怀孕中间十个月，你可以一直吃它。然后"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"产后呢，各种病都可以用当归散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以当归散是一个粉剂。很好用的一个调理的处方。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171026-r3vmt2e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171026-r3vmt2e","updated":"20240422171026"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果说像刚刚讲的漏下不止，怀孕中间下血，这个药就没有用了哦，刚刚那个水肿，你不要用这个药，这是调理的方子。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171026-97li6q8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171026-97li6q8","updated":"20240422171026"}}]}